ral-election polling available, the outlook rests on fundamentals, which point clearly to Allen. Smith would need a substantial external investment or a major national shift to make this race competitive.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0633, "margin": -10.05}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0456, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0466, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0433, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0323, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0215, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0217, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0316, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0333, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0437, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0435, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0652, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0619, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0248, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0276, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0202, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0498, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.037, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0244, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0362, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0559, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0179, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0709, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.0364, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.0654, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.0432, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.0595, "margin": -10.5}]}